{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_164_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_164","textTraditional":"一、十有四年，春，王正月，季孫宿，叔老，會晉士匄、齊人、宋人、衞人、鄭公孫蠆、曹人、莒人、邾人、滕人、薛人、杞人、小邾人，會吳於向。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_164_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_164","textTraditional":"二、二月，乙未，朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_164_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_164","textTraditional":"三、夏，四月，叔孫豹會晉荀偃、齊人、宋人、衞北宮括、鄭公孫蠆、曹人、莒人、邾人、滕人、薛人、杞人、小邾人伐秦。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_164_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_164","textTraditional":"四、己未，衞侯出奔齊。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_164_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_164","textTraditional":"五、莒人侵我東鄙。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_164_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_164","textTraditional":"六、秋，楚公子貞帥師伐吳。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_164_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_164","textTraditional":"七、冬，季孫宿會晉士匄、宋華閱、衞孫林父、鄭公孫蠆、莒人、邾人於戚。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}